# Teim taken to her father: with Teim in a bag, loading the tube ($0E)
# runs LoadSpritesInLevel's tail (ps2.asm:896) -- Teim out of the bag
# (RemoveItemFromInventory), $DE70 = 1, $DE6E = $302, demo 2
# (Demo_TeimScene) and "A Prologue" ($8F). ObjType_TeimDarum's steps
# (loc_E9BA on) show "What's Teim doing?" ($1802), "I'm going to go meet
# my father ..." ($1803) as Teim steps out of the party, and the scene
# runs on through $1804-$1806. Afterwards the tube is open.

start level 0 69 21          # Motavia, east of the tube's east door
wait screen level
wait idle
give Teim
walk left 2                  # 67,21
wait idle
walk left 1                  # the door
wait screen level
limit 6000
wait idle
expect level 14
expect script $1802          # "What's Teim doing?"
shot 01_teim_out
press c
wait idle
expect script $1803
shot 02_meet_father
press c
wait idle
expect script $1804
shot 03_darum
press c
wait idle
shot 04_on
press c
wait idle
shot 05_on
press c
wait idle
shot 06_on
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
bags
state
shot 07_after
expect no-stderr not ported
